Given a step from $t$ to $t + \Delta t$, the method evaluates
$s$ stage derivatives and combines them into the new state:

$$
\begin{aligned}
k_i    &= f\!\left(t + c_i \Delta t,\;
           y + \Delta t \textstyle\sum_{j<i} a_{ij} k_j\right) \\
y_{n+1} &= y_n + \Delta t \textstyle\sum_i b_i k_i
\end{aligned}
$$
